Vnum            10019
Name            palace guard captain~
ShortDesc       王宮衛隊長~
LongDesc        一位威嚴的王宮衛隊長(palace guard captain)守衛著王宮。
~
Description
暴風城精銳騎士中的精銳﹐擔任王宮衛隊長一職。其戰力遠超一般
士兵﹐任何膽敢闖入王宮的不速之客都難逃他的制裁。
~
Sentinel        Yes
StayArea        Yes
AutoSetValue    Yes
Effect          'detect invis'
Effect          'detect hidden'
Effect          'sanctuary'
Alignment       400
Level           75
Hitroll         0
Protect         -1
Damroll         0
Str             -1
Int             -1
Wis             -1
Dex             -1
Con             -1
Hp              -1
Mana            -1
Move            -1
Class           CLASS_GENERAL
Gold            -1
Multipile       100
AttackRatio     100
DodgeRatio      100
Migrate         0
Sex             SEX_MALE

Process
Type            fight_prog
Chance          100
Text
if isnpc($n)
  break
endif
if isimmort($n)
  break
endif
if isenemy($n) != '暴風城'
  mpsetenemy $n '暴風城'
endif
~
End

Process
Type            rand_prog
Chance          20
Text
if rand(20)
  emote 警惕地掃視著周圍…
  say 王宮安全是我的職責！
endif
~
End

End